      "content": "i get what u mean about the tetanus thing but i literally dont have the time or the money for a clinic visit right now. i just need to get through today. can i just use some hydrogen peroxide to kill everything in there and then maybe some superglue to close the hole up? seems like a faster way to handle it so i can get back to work.",
